{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"97069","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/97069","key":"MC-216270","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"19/Feb/21 2:38 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n\n<p>What I expected to happen was for me to able to replace the armor with another piece of armor, like on the Bedrock edition of Minecraft.</p>\n\n<p>What actually happened was that did not happen and it did not do anything when I right click to try and replace the armor.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Grab 2 different pieces of the same type of armor, eg. 1 netherite chestplate and 1 diamond chestplate</li>\n\t<li>Put one of the pieces off armor on the armor slot in the inventory</li>\n\t<li>Put the other piece of armor in the hotbar</li>\n\t<li>Select that piece of armor and right click</li>\n</ol>\n","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"20/Feb/21 7:28 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"31/Jan/23 9:17 AM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"27/Aug/26 2:31 AM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"It's not possible to replace armor by right clicking while holding the armor item","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product. (Migrated on 23 Jan 2025 19:08 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":10303,"hierarchyLevel":0},"watches":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/MC-216270/watch